{txt}{hline 11}{c +}{hline 22}{c +}{hline 10}
     Total {c |}{res}     11.71       6.10 {txt}{c |}{res}    100.00 
{txt}
{com}. 
. * Exporting a clean version for the write-up
. estpost tab wave kessler_cat if !mi(kessler_cat)

